WEBVTT

00:00:16.523 --> 00:00:17.603
-Wazowski!
-(SCREAMS)

00:00:17.723 --> 00:00:19.123
-Whoa!
-Stop the bus!

00:00:19.483 --> 00:00:20.523
(BRAKES SCREECHING)

00:00:21.363 --> 00:00:22.443
Are you crazy?

00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:24.563
(PANTING) Mike,

00:00:24.803 --> 00:00:27.003
I don't know a single Scarer
who can do what you do.

00:00:27.443 --> 00:00:29.323
I know, everyone sees us together,

00:00:29.483 --> 00:00:31.923
they think I'm the one running the show,
but the truth is,

00:00:32.003 --> 00:00:34.883
I've been riding your coattails
since day one!

00:00:35.283 --> 00:00:36.923
You made the deal with Hardscrabble.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.683
You took a hopeless team
and made them champions.

00:00:39.763 --> 00:00:41.243
All I did was catch a pig!

00:00:41.603 --> 00:00:42.883
Technically, I caught the pig.

00:00:43.283 --> 00:00:46.203
Exactly! And you think you're just okay?

00:00:46.283 --> 00:00:48.723
You pulled off the biggest Scare
this school has ever seen!

00:00:48.963 --> 00:00:50.883
-That wasn't me!
-That was you!

00:00:51.003 --> 00:00:53.083
You think I could have done that
without you?

00:00:53.163 --> 00:00:55.523
I didn't even bring a pencil
on the first day of school.

00:00:57.923 --> 00:01:00.523
Mike, you're not scary. Not even a little.

00:01:00.603 --> 00:01:02.043
But you are fearless.

00:01:04.203 --> 00:01:06.763
And if Hardscrabble can't see that,
then she can just...

00:01:06.843 --> 00:01:08.963
I can just what?

00:01:10.723 --> 00:01:14.043
Careful, Mr. Sullivan.
I was just warming up to you.

00:01:14.963 --> 00:01:15.963
Sorry.

00:01:16.363 --> 00:01:17.923
Well, gentlemen,

00:01:19.323 --> 00:01:22.683
it seems you made the front page again.

00:01:24.843 --> 00:01:26.323
The two of you did something together

00:01:26.763 --> 00:01:28.763
that no one has ever done before.

00:01:29.963 --> 00:01:31.323
You surprised me.

00:01:32.803 --> 00:01:36.403
Perhaps I should keep an eye out
for more surprises

00:01:36.483 --> 00:01:38.003
like you in my program.

00:01:38.963 --> 00:01:41.923
But as far as the two of you
are concerned

00:01:42.003 --> 00:01:44.003
there is nothing I can do for you now.

00:01:45.243 --> 00:01:48.403
Except, perhaps, wish you luck.

00:01:52.083 --> 00:01:55.963
And, Mr. Wazowski,
keep surprising people.

00:02:06.283 --> 00:02:09.843
You know, there is still one way
we can work at a Scare company.

00:02:13.523 --> 00:02:15.523
They're always hiring in the mailroom.

00:02:19.883 --> 00:02:21.723
This is better than I ever imagined!

00:02:21.803 --> 00:02:24.483
I bet we break the all-time record
in our first year.

00:02:24.563 --> 00:02:26.003
Mike, we're mail guys.

00:02:26.083 --> 00:02:29.283
I know. I'm talking about
the record for letters delivered!

00:02:29.363 --> 00:02:30.403
(GASPS)

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:33.243
All right, newbies, quit goofing around.

00:02:33.323 --> 00:02:35.883
I'll have you know tampering
with the mail is a crime

00:02:35.963 --> 00:02:37.923
-punishable by banishment!
-Yes, sir.

00:02:38.003 --> 00:02:39.603
We're right on it, Mr. Snowman.

00:02:39.683 --> 00:02:41.123
The team of Wazowski and Sullivan

00:02:41.203 --> 00:02:43.323
are going to change the world
starting today!

00:02:43.403 --> 00:02:44.443
Say scream!

00:02:44.523 --> 00:02:45.563
-Scream!
-Scream!

00:02:46.083 --> 00:02:47.723
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:03:29.923 --> 00:03:31.403
Wazowski, good luck on your first day!

00:03:31.483 --> 00:03:32.563
Thanks, Merv.

00:03:32.643 --> 00:03:34.643
-Good luck, Mike!
-Thanks, fellas.

00:03:37.523 --> 00:03:39.603
(ALL CHATTERING INDISTINCTLY)

00:03:41.363 --> 00:03:42.723
You coming, Coach?

00:03:44.123 --> 00:03:45.523
You better believe it.

00:03:47.363 --> 00:03:48.603
(EXHALES)

